OVERVIEW

This system is built in Microsoft 365 using:
- SharePoint lists
- SharePoint document libraries
- Power Apps customized forms
- Power Automate
- Excel Online tables

Purpose:
- Manage clients
- Log activities
- Auto-generate SOAP and Conceptualization documents
- Save those documents into the correct client folder
- Write document links back to the Activity Log
- Log hours into Excel

--------------------------------------------------
1. CURRENT ARCHITECTURE
--------------------------------------------------

The system is now split into two separate processes.

A. CLIENT PROCESS
Handles:
- creating the client record
- normalizing/storing client naming data
- creating the client folder in Clinical Documents
- storing folder-related data back on the Clients list

B. ACTIVITY LOG PROCESS
Handles:
- using an existing client if one is selected
- generating SOAP and Conceptualization docs when appropriate
- saving those docs into the client folder
- writing links back to Activity Log
- logging activity to Excel

Important architectural rule:
- Activity Log does NOT create clients
- Activity Log does NOT create folders
- Activity Log only uses existing client/folder data if a client is selected

