10. FOLDER PATH FIX — IMPORTANT
--------------------------------------------------

The key folder-path issue in the new flow was:

Wrong:
- using Get Item - Client body/path

That returned the SharePoint list-item path, something like:
- Lists/Clients/

Correct:
- use the actual custom folder path value for the client
- or otherwise use the properly derived client folder path

This fix was required for successful file creation in the correct client folder.

--------------------------------------------------
11. SOAP / CONCEPT LINK FIX — IMPORTANT
--------------------------------------------------

Another major working fix:

The original saved document links were wrong and produced 404 errors.

Bad link example:
- missing /sites/PracticeOperations

Correct solution:
- build the document URL using:
  - https://branchpointco.sharepoint.com/sites/PracticeOperations
  - plus the correct metadata Path from the created file

Correct SOAP URL compose expression:

replace(
  concat(
    'https://branchpointco.sharepoint.com/sites/PracticeOperations',
    outputs('Get_File_Metadata_-SOAP')?['body/Path']
  ),
  ' ',
  '%20'
)

Correct Concept URL compose expression:

replace(
  concat(
    'https://branchpointco.sharepoint.com/sites/PracticeOperations',
    outputs('Get_File_Metadata-_Concept')?['body/Path']
  ),
  ' ',
  '%20'
)

Important result:
- SOAP link now works
- Conceptualization link now works

